## Theme & loading

- JSON `theme` → `MobileThemeConfig` → `EngineTheme` in `dataContext`; avoid a second hardcoded theme in `main.dart`
- `loadingRequestKeys`, `requests.{key}` — list/grid use `request_ui_state.dart`

